Parabola conic sections mein se ek hai. Circle mein ek fixed point aur fixed faasla tha; parabola mein ek fixed point aur ek fixed line hai. Aage ellipse aur hyperbola mein do fixed points aayenge.
Is section ka plan:
6.3.1 standard equation \(y^{2} = 4ax\) derive karna;
6.3.2 is ke hisson ke naam (axis, vertex, focal chord, latus rectum, \(t\)-point);
6.3.3 baqi teen standard forms aur shift kiya hua parabola (Example 17);
6.3.4 line \(y = mx + c\) parabola \(y^{2} = 4ax\) ko kab touch karti hai (condition of tangency);
6.3.5 parabola ke kisi point par tangent aur normal.
